helo:0000008 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "task capability goal"@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000114 obo:IAO_0000125 ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A learning goal that states what a learner is intended to be able to do, and that is met by applying or creating, carrying out or using a procedure in a given situation or producing something new, such as querying a knowledge graph or publishing a vocabulary. A curriculum or a course module may have one, and a learning pathway may not."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000116 "Apply and Create in the revised Bloom taxonomy (Krathwohl 2002)."@en ;
    obo:IAO_0000117 "Michelle Ashley (drafted with Claude)" ;
    obo:IAO_0000119 "Baines D. Scope of the learning pathways ontology, 18 October 2026, passed on by Michelle Ashley in the HELO 0.2.0 brief; The Semantic Layer for Health Economics, course outline draft for Michelle Ashley and Darrin Baines, 18 October 2026; Krathwohl 2002" ;
